            "content": "Our Microsoft Cloud revenue, which includes Microsoft 365 Commercial cloud, Azure and other cloud services, the commercial portion of LinkedIn, and Dynamics 365, was $214.4 billion, $168.9 billion, and $137.7 billion in fiscal years 2026, 2025, and 2024, respectively.",
